  "_about": "Binding Simplified Chinese terms and phrase rules, enforced by scripts/i18n/check-zh.js. `keep`: names and IDs that stay as written (added to the keep list in glossary.json). `terms`: when the Korean source contains `ko`, the Chinese target must contain `zh` or one of `alts` (strict ones are errors). `banned`: errors. `avoid`: warnings above `max` hits per segment. Reasons and sources: i18n/zh-style-notes.md.",
